Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 06:05:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add LatentMAS latent-step mode to the V1 engine.

For flagged requests, feed realign(last_hidden) as the next inputs_embeds,
append agent role prompts as ordinary tokens on the same request, keep KV
in-engine through Judger decode, and store latent embeds so preemption
recompute replays them.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
